s: campaigns, personal discounts and request decisions made in Admin — Discounts & offers update the website pages live (Offers, Experiences, tour page, Booking). Switch “Viewing as” to Assistant to see view-only permissions. Only the single best discount ever applies to a booking."}, "t_pw": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Website at phone width (390 px)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 4150, "page": "phone-web"}, "t_pa": {"x": 0, "y": -300, "text": "Admin at phone width (390 px)", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2270, "page": "phone-admin"}, "n_pw": {"x": 4310, "y": 0, "w": 360, "page": "phone-web", "fill": "blue", "text": "These are the real responsive pages rendered in a 390 px frame — generated from the same code as the desktop pages, not separate mock-ups. Edit a page on the Public website page; these previews are regenerated from it on the next update."}, "n_pa": {"x": 2390, "y": 0, "w": 360, "page": "phone-admin", "fill": "blue", "text": "On phones and tablets the admin sidebar becomes a top bar with a slide-out menu (tap ☰). Tables turn into stacked cards; side panels open full-screen; sticky action bars keep primary buttons in thumb reach."}}, "designSystems": []}